{"id":"Wa5579c588ce0de1239d2fb00","zh":"轨道不平顺谱","en":"","name":"轨道不平顺谱","language":"zh","domain":"车辆轨道基础结构动力学","concept_id":null,"families":[],"definition_zh":null,"definition_en":null,"scope_note":null,"usage_note":null,"usage_overview":null,"translation_note":null,"usage_variants":[],"designations":[{"id":"Wa5579c588ce0de1239d2fb00","text":"轨道不平顺谱","language":"zh","role":"headword"}],"complete_examples":[{"id":"S2e41ea7f6adbcfe61246","source_id":"P106","page":6,"page_end":6,"language":"zh","text":"4.2 轨道不平顺谱顺拟合图8~图11 为采用铁科院7 参数拟合公式以及分段拟合后的结果,有效波长范围1~70 m。","citations":[{"source_id":"P106","page":6,"page_end":6}]},{"id":"Sacff3da440b129049162","source_id":"P106","page":9,"page_end":9,"language":"zh","text":"沪昆线与金温线轨道不平顺谱分析[J].","citations":[{"source_id":"P106","page":9,"page_end":9}]},{"id":"S7536e5760b221515e2ad","source_id":"P116","page":1,"page_end":1,"language":"zh","text":"为了给青藏铁路养护维修、动力评估提供更为科学合理的车辆-轨道系统激振源和评判依据,基于青藏铁路较为充实的实测数据(累计里程为9. 23万km),对其轨道不平顺谱展开系统研究。","citations":[{"source_id":"P116","page":1,"page_end":1}]},{"id":"S6c04c8295ba74145a478","source_id":"P116","page":2,"page_end":2,"language":"zh","text":"因此直接利用轨道不平顺检测数据计算轨道不平顺谱误差较大,需要对检测数据进行预处理,剔除异常值和趋势项。","citations":[{"source_id":"P116","page":2,"page_end":2}]},{"id":"Sb885508d8f3f2ab05935","source_id":"P122","page":2,"page_end":2,"language":"zh","text":"为了提高轨道不平顺谱的计算精度,在计算轨道不平顺谱时,一般应进行数据预处理,采用文献[3]方法进行异常数据剔除。","citations":[{"source_id":"P122","page":2,"page_end":2}]},{"id":"Sfcb3416e3cc19dcd79fd","source_id":"P122","page":6,"page_end":6,"language":"zh","text":"针对3.1 节所重点分析的某200 m 线路区段,采用HHT 时频谱分析方法,在轨道不平顺谱分析的基础上进一步提取轨道局部不平顺特征。","citations":[{"source_id":"P122","page":6,"page_end":6}]},{"id":"Scfb266780472e7c97a74","source_id":"P124","page":2,"page_end":2,"language":"zh","text":"轨道不平顺谱的计算分析 1.1 数据来源及谱估计方法轨道不平顺样本数据来源于2010 年沪宁、沪杭高速铁路和2011 年京沪高速铁路的检测数据, 采样间距为0.25 m。","citations":[{"source_id":"P124","page":2,"page_end":2}]},{"id":"S94c1a9f3aef12ed09f57","source_id":"P124","page":2,"page_end":2,"language":"zh","text":"1.2 线路轨道不平顺谱分布特征图1 所示为京沪高铁左轨向、左高低不平顺, 以及京沪高铁右轨向、右高低不平顺的功率谱密度计算结果; 表1 所示为京沪、沪宁、沪杭高铁各几何不平顺谱线对应峰值波长及特征周期性波长。","citations":[{"source_id":"P124","page":2,"page_end":2}]}],"sources":{"P056":{"id":"P056","title":"On dynamic analysis method for large-scale train–track–substructure interaction","authors":"L Xu","year":"2022","doi":"10.1007/s40534-021-00265-8","journal_citation":"Railway Engineering Science 30 (2), 162-182","label":"Xu（2022）","overview_slug":"2022-on-dynamic-analysis-method-for-large-scale-train-track-substructure-interaction"},"P106":{"id":"P106","title":"青藏铁路轨道不平顺谱研究","authors":"陈宪麦,徐磊,王卫东,贺天龙,张向民,向尚,陈文韬","year":"2016","doi":"10.19713/j.cnki.43-1423/u.2016.09.005","journal_citation":"铁道科学与工程学报","label":"陈宪麦等（2016）","overview_slug":"2016-research-on-track-irregularity-power-spectrum-density-of-qinghai-tibet-railway"},"P116":{"id":"P116","title":"青藏铁路轨道不平顺界限谱研究","authors":"徐磊,翟婉明,陈宪麦,高建敏","year":"2018","doi":"10.3969/j.issn.1001-8360.2018.05.015","journal_citation":"铁道学报","label":"徐磊等（2018）","overview_slug":"2018-research-on-track-irregularity-boundary-psds-of-qinghai-tibet-railway"},"P122":{"id":"P122","title":"朔黄重载铁路轨道不平顺谱分析","authors":"徐磊,陈宪麦,李晓健,孟宪洪","year":"2013","doi":null,"journal_citation":"中南大学学报(自然科学版)","label":"徐磊等（2013）","overview_slug":"2013-track-irregularity-spectrum-analysis-of-shenchi-huanghua-heavy-haul-railway"},"P124":{"id":"P124","title":"高速铁路( 京沪、沪宁、沪杭线) 轨道不平顺谱分析","authors":"陈宪麦,徐磊,徐伟昌,董连成","year":"2013","doi":"10.19713/j.cnki.43-1423/u.2013.04.001","journal_citation":"铁道科学与工程学报","label":"陈宪麦等（2013）","overview_slug":"2013-analysis-of-track-irregularity-spectrum-for-high-speed-railway-beijing-shanghai-shanghai-hangzhou-an"}},"relations":[],"related_terms":[],"collocations":[],"symbols":[],"units":[],"formulas":[],"external_references":[],"suggested_comparisons":[],"contexts":[{"text":"描述不同空间波长上不平顺能量分布，用于识别线路特征。","language":"zh","source_id":"P124","paper_slug":"2013-analysis-of-track-irregularity-spectrum-for-high-speed-railway-beijing-shanghai-shanghai-hangzhou-an","title":"高速铁路（京沪、沪宁、沪杭线）轨道不平顺谱分析","kind":"paper_usage"},{"text":"描述轨道几何不平顺在不同空间频率上的强度分布。","language":"zh","source_id":"P106","paper_slug":"2016-research-on-track-irregularity-power-spectrum-density-of-qinghai-tibet-railway","title":"青藏铁路轨道不平顺谱研究","kind":"paper_usage"},{"text":"描述轨道几何偏差在不同空间频率上的能量分布，是动力计算的激振输入。","language":"zh","source_id":"P116","paper_slug":"2018-research-on-track-irregularity-boundary-psds-of-qinghai-tibet-railway","title":"青藏铁路轨道不平顺界限谱研究","kind":"paper_usage"},{"text":"以空间频率描述轨道几何不平顺，并用于生成动力激励。","language":"zh","source_id":"P056","paper_slug":"2022-on-dynamic-analysis-method-for-large-scale-train-track-substructure-interaction","title":"大规模列车—轨道—下部结构相互作用的动力分析方法","kind":"paper_usage"},{"text":"轨道不平顺随空间频率或波长变化的统计谱表示。","kind":"sense","language":"zh","source_id":null,"paper_slug":null,"title":"义项 · 车辆轨道随机动力学","concept_id":"C20e082cb08180dd04b1f"},{"text":"轨道不平顺随空间频率或波长变化的统计谱表示。","kind":"sense","language":"zh","source_id":null,"paper_slug":null,"title":"义项 · 轨道不平顺与信号处理","concept_id":"C29a03110e5c943779ce2"},{"text":"轨道不平顺随空间频率或波长变化的统计谱表示。","kind":"sense","language":"zh","source_id":null,"paper_slug":null,"title":"义项 · 轨道结构与动力学","concept_id":"C5cb62ee1c5aa825b4773"},{"text":"表示轨道几何不平顺频率统计特征的谱。","kind":"sense","language":"zh","source_id":null,"paper_slug":null,"title":"义项 · 车辆轨道基础结构动力学","concept_id":"C932f6c37cbc8d6907383"}],"word_links":[{"id":"Wf1b5c74328d8be0e022224cf","name":"track irregularity spectrum","language":"en","kind":"translation","label":"对应表达","reason":null},{"id":"W888f5ced904ade95ee7dfdf5","name":"track irregularity power spectrum density","language":"en","kind":"translation","label":"对应表达","reason":null},{"id":"Wda4b4a70ec90616dd2f4ffbd","name":"track irregularity spectrums","language":"en","kind":"translation","label":"参考译法","reason":null}],"expression_links":[{"id":"Wf1b5c74328d8be0e022224cf","name":"track irregularity spectrum","language":"en","kind":"translation","label":"对应表达","reason":nul